@startuml state_machine_diagram
title RobotStateMachine State Transitions

skinparam state {
    BorderColor #333333
    FontColor #222222
    AttributeFontColor #333333
}
skinparam ArrowColor #555555
skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam note {
    BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
    BorderColor #BDB76B
}

[*] --> Stanby : Power on

state "Stanby\nManual mode" as Stanby #DDEBF7
state "Ready\nAuto standby" as Ready #E2F0D9
state "Moving\nAuto navigation" as Moving #C6E0B4
state "Tracking\nTarget tracking" as Tracking #C6E0B4
state "Goal\nTarget reached" as Goal #FFF2CC
state "Fail\nSafety fallback" as Fail #F4CCCC

Stanby -[#2F75B5]-> Ready : Auto mode &\nlocalization_success
Ready -[#548235]-> Moving : navigation_status = Moving
Moving -[#548235]-> Goal : navigation_status = Goal
Goal -[#2F75B5]-> Ready : navigation_status = Ready
Ready -[#548235]-> Tracking : navigation_status = Tracking
Tracking -[#2F75B5]-> Ready : Tracking released

Moving -[#BF9000]-> Ready : Cancel (left stick push)
Tracking -[#BF9000]-> Ready : Release / Cancel
Ready -[#BF9000]-> Stanby : Switch to manual mode

Stanby -[#C00000,dashed]-> Fail : Common fail-safe

note right of Fail
  Common transitions to Fail:
  - operation_t timeout > 200 ms
  - localization_success == false

  In Fail, navigation_command = Sleep.
  Recovers when valid operation_t
  is received in auto mode.
end note

note bottom
  In auto mode, receiving valid operation_t
  synchronizes current_status_ with
  latest_op.navigation_status.
end note
@enduml
